title: "Simple symmetric Venn diagrams with 17 curves"
authors:
  - family-names: Dzoba
    given-names: Chris
date-released: 2026-09-18
version: "1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dzoba/venn17"
url: "https://github.com/dzoba/venn17"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - Venn diagram
  - symmetric
  - combinatorics
  - certificate
abstract: >-
  Simple, rotationally symmetric Venn diagrams with 17 curves, the smallest open
  case since the 11- and 13-curve diagrams of Mamakani and Ruskey (2014), given as
  machine-checkable certificates, together with a standalone checker, the search
  program that found them, a plotter and the write-up. Also includes the first
  non-monotone simple symmetric Venn diagrams with 11 and 13 curves.
